    "user_request_original": "Design a high-layer-count periodic bandpass filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack: 10 periods of HfO2/SiO2 (Gao) quarter-wave pairs, one HfO2 cavity layer at center, then 10 periods of SiO2 (Gao)/HfO2 quarter-wave pairs. Total 21 layers. Optimize all individual layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm while minimizing transmittance in 300-700 nm and 700-1100 nm. No metal layers. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Gao).",
    "normalized_request_english": "Design a 21-layer periodic bandpass filter on fused silica with air incidence. Stack consists of five HfO2/SiO2 pairs, a central HfO2 layer, and five SiO2/HfO2 pairs. Optimize all 21 layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 255–280 nm while minimizing transmittance in 300–700 nm and 700–1100 nm. No metals. Use registry-resolved optical constants for HfO2 and SiO2.",
